        "id": 99598,
        "name": "Humble-Knight",
        "username": "Humble-Knight",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/humble-knight/{size}/2259_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-18T17:52:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There are cataclysmic events referenced in tactics updates, and Christopher has confirmed that tactics takes place a few years after the end of the card game.</p>\n<p>I like your Dark watch being a reaction to government crack down, especially since they are all street level heros. However I think I read that the dark watch was formed to stop gloomweaver, which is why they are called that. They are watching to keep out the dark.</p>\n<p>I think the stuff about vengeance is very possible, and even if it’s not the precipitating event, it is a contributing factor.</p>",
